   "subject": "undefined exports:",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">if you delete a function, the namespace is not updated prior to loading leading to errors like:<div><br></div><div><div>Loading umx</div><div>Error in namespaceExport(nsenv, exports) : undefined exports: umx_library</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>The work around is to manually edit the namespace file.</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
